### 1. Install Dependencies
Install the official Datadog React Native core SDK and the React Navigation integration package:

```bash
yarn add @datadog/mobile-react-native @datadog/mobile-react-navigation
```

For iOS projects, synchronize CocoaPods:
```bash
cd ios && pod install --repo-update && cd ..
