## 4. Distributed APM Tracing (Mobile to Backend)

In traditional systems, when an API fails with HTTP 500, backend engineers see an isolated server trace without knowing which user or screen triggered it. 

With **Distributed APM Tracing**, the Datadog mobile SDK injects cryptographic correlation headers into every HTTP request made to designated internal domains:

