## 1. The 4-Tier Version Governance Matrix

Version enforcement operates across four distinct operational tiers:

<div class="portal-table-wrap">
  <table class="portal-table">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Governance Tier</th>
        <th>Condition</th>
        <th>User Experience &amp; Enforcement Action</th>
        <th>Primary Use Case</th>
