## 5. Development &amp; CI Bypass Rules

Automated End-to-End (E2E) tests and local developer builds must not be blocked when working against unreleased branch versions.

### Safe Bypass Environment Flags
```bash
# In local development (.env.development):
BYPASS_VERSION_GATE=true

# In Bitrise CI UI testing steps:
export BYPASS_VERSION_GATE=true
```

In your gating controller, ensure the bypass flag is strictly ignored in `production` release builds:

```typescript
const isBypassed = __DEV__ && process.env.BYPASS_VERSION_GATE === 'true';

if (isBypassed) {
  console.warn('[VersionGate] Bypassed version enforcement for development build.');
  return { gateStatus: 'ALLOWED' };
}
```



